OL,3,GNEWSAFour people die in Bootle house
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have died and a fifth has
OL,7,Fbeen taken to hospital with burns after
OL,8,Fa house fire on Merseyside.
OL,10,FSix fire engines were at the scene at
OL,11,Fthe height of the blaze at the
OL,12,Fsemi-detached property in Stone Square
OL,13,Fin Bootle, Sefton, at 03:45 BST.
OL,15,FEight firefighters searched the house
OL,16,Fwhere they discovered four people in an
OL,17,Fupstairs bedroom, showing no signs of
OL,18,Flife, Merseyside Fire and Rescue
OL,19,FService said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
